Diagnose and recover the bundled Grafana admin account. The platform ingress gate and Grafana's own login are separate layers: these commands probe from inside the Grafana pod, so they report only the Grafana login layer.

Usage:
  mcp-runtime sentinel grafana [command]

Available Commands:
  check                Check that Grafana accepts the configured admin credentials (read-only)
  reset-admin-password Back up Grafana and reset the persisted admin password to the configured value

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for grafana

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging

Use "mcp-runtime sentinel grafana [command] --help" for more information about a command.
